  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Economic Community of West African States (ECOWAS) Renewable Energy Facility 2030</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Capitalization and launch of the ECOWAS Renewable Energy Facility 2030 (EREF2030), a USD 75 million concessional finance facility to support small and medium sized renewable energy and energy efficiency (RE&amp;amp;EE) projects and businesses in rural and peri-urban areas of the ECOWAS member countries.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective is to obtain firm commitment from multilateral agencies, bilateral agencies, foundations, and other potential concessional finance providers towards capitalization of ECOWAS Renewable Energy Facility 2030.The technical assistance from GGGI will co-finance specific workstreams to establish and operationalize EREF2030.</narrative>
  </description>
